Authorization headers, cookies, API keys, tokens, secrets, and credential fields are never recorded. Each request and response side is limited to 256 KB and follows request-history retention.|不记录授权头、Cookie、API 密钥、Token 及凭据字段。请求与响应各限 256 KB，并遵循请求历史保留策略。
Automatically refresh provider model catalogs and keep capability metadata current.|自动刷新渠道模型目录及能力元数据。
Automatically update the online reference catalog. Recorded bills and configured rate cards retain their original values.|自动更新在线参考目录；历史账本与已配置价目表保留原值。
Back up current configuration, accounts and keys. Request history, conversations, old revisions and drafts are excluded.|仅备份当前配置、账号和密钥，不含请求历史、会话、旧版本和草稿。
Capture detailed request and response payloads for troubleshooting.|记录请求与响应详情，用于排查问题。
Change the reviewed default route or replace it with an ordered custom route.|调整已审核的默认路由，或替换为有序自定义路由。
Choose a known channel to prefill the editable endpoint and Ferry text conversion policy. Credentials are never supplied by a preset.|选择渠道预设以填入端点和文本协议转换策略；预设不包含凭据。
Choose an API configuration or a dedicated Codex OAuth flow.|选择 API 配置或专用 Codex OAuth 流程。
Choose an account, then manage its routing gate, credential, subscription usage, and proxied models.|选择账户后，管理其路由开关、凭据、订阅用量和代理模型。
Choose at least one route.|至少选择一条路由。
Choose whether Ferry appends the standard protocol path or uses one exact request URL.|选择自动拼接标准协议路径，或使用完整请求 URL。
Client impact detected.|检测到客户端影响。
Combines saved declarations with cached endpoint evidence for this Provider, model and native protocol.|结合此渠道、模型、原生协议的已保存声明与端点验证缓存。
Create the connection, then complete OAuth callback.|创建连接后完成 OAuth 回调。
Default 10. Applies only to aggregators listed in logical_model_policy.json (OpenRouter by default). Other providers have no automatic creation limit. Set 0 to require manual selection for listed aggregators. Existing Logical Models stay intact.|默认 10，仅限制 logical_model_policy.json 白名单中的聚合渠道（默认 OpenRouter）。其他渠道自动创建不限数量；设为 0 时白名单渠道需手动选择。已有逻辑模型保留。
