Estimated affected traffic|预计受影响流量
Every catalog model is already configured for this protocol.|此协议已配置目录中的全部模型。
Every condition group below must pass. A group with no selection adds no restriction and passes automatically.|下方条件组需全部满足；未选择内容的组不增加限制。
