Export includes exact counts, token and cost dimensions, and UTC window boundaries. Cancellations are separate above and count as unsuccessful in client success rates. Costs cover recorded amounts only.|导出包含精确次数、Token、费用维度和 UTC 周期边界。取消请求单独列出，并计入未成功请求；费用仅包含已记录金额。
