Matching conditional rules and collecting candidate evidence.|正在匹配条件规则并收集候选依据。
Maximum 16 KiB. Responses are used only for runtime health and quota accounting.|最多 16 KiB，响应仅用于运行健康与额度统计。
May increase each backup by several GB. Leave off for small configuration backups.|可能使每次备份增加数 GB；轻量配置备份请保持关闭。
Metadata and expiry do not reveal or replace the token value.|元数据和有效期更改不会显示或替换 Token 原值。
Mode|模式
Model, protocol, compatibility, expiry, rate, and budget policies are enforced by the data-plane Scheduler.|模型、协议、兼容性、有效期、速率和预算策略由数据面调度器执行。
Models explicitly assigned to this protocol endpoint. Catalog entries are suggestions until selected and verified.|明确分配给此协议端点的模型；目录条目需选择并验证后才作为能力依据。
New conversations use the new revision. In-flight requests always finish on the revision they started with.|新会话使用新版本，执行中的请求继续使用开始时的版本。
New requests may use this provider when its route is eligible.|路由符合条件时，新请求可使用此渠道。
No native models detected. Type a model and press Enter to add it manually.|未检测到原生模型；输入模型名称并按回车手动添加。
