One endpoint configuration with native protocol supply and explicit Ferry conversion coverage.|统一管理端点、原生协议支持及 Ferry 协议转换范围。
One endpoint, credential, and upstream model catalog.|统一管理端点、凭据与上游模型目录。
Only the checked recovery failures or no eligible connection advance to the next route. Client request errors stop immediately.|仅在选定失败条件或无合格连接时进入下一路由；客户端请求错误立即结束。
Open a revision for its actor, source, resources, and before/after diff.|打开版本查看操作人、来源、资源和前后差异。
OpenAI Images remains native-only|OpenAI Images 仅支持原生路径
Ordinary tokens can inspect, draft, validate and simulate. The switch additionally permits activation, secrets, credentials, API key lifecycle, OAuth writes, and runtime overrides.|普通 Token 可查看、起草、校验和模拟。开启后额外允许配置生效、密钥与凭据管理、API 密钥生命周期、OAuth 写入及运行覆盖。
Per connection. 0 keeps concurrency unlimited.|按连接设置；0 表示不限制并发。
Per-key monthly budgets are enforced against recorded cost. Missing prices can undercount budget consumption. Runtime quota/cooling and key spikes produce persistent in-app alerts.|每个密钥的月预算按已记录费用执行；缺失价格可能导致低估。额度、冷却和流量突增会生成持续的应用内告警。
Permits activation, credential and secret changes, API key lifecycle, OAuth writes, and manual runtime overrides. This can be changed later.|允许配置生效、凭据和密钥更改、API 密钥生命周期、OAuth 写入及手动运行覆盖，之后可调整。
Rank and exclusion evidence from the same planner used for live requests.|使用与真实请求相同的规划器，展示排序与排除依据。
Read from model routes and immutable revisions.|读取模型路由及不可变版本。
Read this channel’s model catalog independently from capability verification.|单独读取此渠道的模型目录，不执行能力验证。
Reference an existing store:, env:, or oauth: credential.|引用现有的 store:、env: 或 oauth: 凭据。
Reject safe mappings and cross-protocol conversion before any upstream attempt.|在调用上游前拒绝安全映射及跨协议转换。
Request volume and success rate across the selected window. Provider charts use the actual upstream that handled each request.|展示当前周期的请求量与成功率，渠道图表按实际处理请求的上游统计。
Requests moved|迁移请求数
Requests prefer a healthy native path for their client protocol. Other native protocols remain available as conversion fallback.|请求优先使用对应客户端协议的健康原生路径，其他原生协议可作为转换回退。
Requests using this key will fail immediately. This action is intentionally separate from editing scope.|使用此密钥的请求将立即失败；撤销与编辑权限范围分别操作。
Requests without an upstream selection remain in the totals.|未选中上游的请求仍计入总数。
Restore Draft → Validate → Review → Apply|恢复草稿 → 校验 → 审核 → 应用
Result|结果
Reveal and copy remain available from the API Keys page.|之后仍可在 API 密钥页查看并复制。
Rules run from top to bottom. The first enabled rule whose conditions all match adjusts the default route.|规则从上到下执行，首个已启用且满足全部条件的规则调整默认路由。
Runs during the daily backup window when due. Each upload is downloaded and verified. Temporary verification copies are removed. Deployment rollback backups always include all databases.|到期后在每日备份窗口执行，每次上传后下载校验并移除临时校验副本。发布回滚备份始终包含全部数据库。
Runtime signals are healthy.|运行指标正常。
STARTING NATIVE PROBE|正在开始原生验证
Save Provider changes before syncing now.|立即同步前请先保存渠道更改。
Scheduled catalog sync is unavailable|定时目录同步不可用
Select gpt-image-2 to proxy image generation and editing through a supported paid Codex account.|选择 gpt-image-2，通过受支持的付费 Codex 账户代理图像生成与编辑。
Selected catalog models are highlighted in green and added to the configured list. Existing capabilities are preserved for unchanged models.|选中的目录模型会突出显示并加入配置列表；未更改的模型保留原有能力。
Selected models are highlighted and added to the active account.|选中的模型会突出显示并加入当前账户。
Selected weekdays and the time window are combined with AND. Leave either one blank to allow any day or any time.|星期与时间段需同时满足；任一项留空则不限制该项。
Send this Provider a canonical user message through its selected text model. Each Provider is configured independently.|通过选定文本模型向此渠道发送标准用户消息，各渠道独立配置。
Shared by concurrency and upstream-throttle waiters. 0 uses 256.|并发和上游限流等待共用队列，0 表示使用默认值 256。
Ferry uses this separate credential only to list models for the selected Plan. It is never replaced with the Provider API key and never used for inference or capability probes.|此独立凭据仅用于读取所选套餐的模型目录，不会替换渠道 API 密钥，也不用于推理或能力验证。
Ferry will load the Codex catalog automatically.|Ferry 将自动加载 Codex 模型目录。
Standard text-token estimate in USD, excluding tools, media, service-tier adjustments and recovery attempts. It is not the subscription charge or the historical bill.|按标准文本 Token 估算的美元金额，不含工具、媒体、服务等级调整及恢复尝试；不代表订阅费用或历史账单。
Start with route 1. Continue only for the failure types selected on that route, or when it has no eligible connection. Client request errors stop immediately.|从路由 1 开始，仅在该路由选定的失败类型或无合格连接时继续。客户端请求错误立即结束。
Starts after creation|创建后开始
Store a new secret in SQLite without echoing it.|将新密钥写入 SQLite，且不回显原值。
Strict fallback · no silent downgrade|严格回退 · 不静默降级
Structured Runtime|结构化运行状态
Subscription limits for this OAuth account, shown from cache while refreshing on entry.|展示此 OAuth 账户的订阅额度；进入时刷新，同时显示缓存结果。
Subscription usage for each OAuth account, visible on the Provider page without opening the editor.|直接在渠道页查看各 OAuth 账户订阅用量，无需打开编辑器。
Supported paid Codex accounts can proxy gpt-image-2 image generation and editing after authentication.|受支持的付费 Codex 账户完成认证后可代理 gpt-image-2 图像生成与编辑。
The Codex catalog loads automatically when this editor opens.|打开编辑器时自动加载 Codex 目录。
The Provider gate and at least one OAuth account gate above must both be enabled for Route traffic.|只有渠道开关与至少一个 OAuth 账户开关同时启用，才能承接路由流量。
The Provider must be enabled and expose a supported catalog.|渠道须已启用并提供受支持的目录。
The connection exists but remains unauthenticated until callback completion.|连接已创建，完成回调前仍未认证。
The connection is enabled after its configuration and credential are accepted.|配置和凭据校验通过后启用连接。
The effective route produced no connection candidates.|生效路由没有产生候选连接。
The full key remains available to authenticated administrators.|已认证管理员之后仍可查看完整密钥。
The persisted login can be continued after a restart.|重启后可继续已保存的登录流程。
The raw bearer token is shown once after creation. Ferry stores only its verifier hash.|Bearer Token 原值仅在创建后显示一次，Ferry 仅保存校验哈希。
The request must satisfy every selected capability and every non-zero token minimum.|请求须满足全部选定能力及所有非零 Token 下限。
The review preserves the selected failure conditions and conversation strategy. Nothing changes until Apply succeeds.|审核保留所选失败条件与会话策略；应用成功后才生效。
The same Provider may appear more than once with different upstream models.|同一渠道可使用不同上游模型多次出现在路由中。
The selected time is sent as RFC3339 and evaluated in each conditional rule's configured timezone. Runtime health, quota and capability evidence remain read-only.|所选时间以 RFC3339 发送，并按各条件规则的时区求值；运行健康、额度和能力依据仅供读取。
The server validates the configuration before applying it. Imported OAuth token fields go only to the protected local credential store.|服务端校验配置后才应用，导入的 OAuth Token 仅写入受保护的本地凭据存储。
The upstream catalog loads automatically when this editor opens.|打开编辑器时自动加载上游目录。
These settings only restrict what this API key may call and consume. They do not change Provider or Logical Model routing.|这些设置仅限制此 API 密钥的调用和消费，不更改渠道或逻辑模型路由。
This Provider has no supported authenticated model catalog. Ferry will not substitute capability probes or inference requests.|此渠道没有受支持的认证模型目录，Ferry 不会改用能力验证或推理请求。
This route was simulated without enabling client traffic.|已模拟此路由，未启用客户端流量。
This switch gates the global schedule only. Each Provider keeps its own interval (30 min / 1 hour / off), and Sync now always remains available.|此开关仅控制全局定时计划，各渠道保留自己的周期（30 分钟 / 1 小时 / 关闭），仍可立即同步。
Token-weighted cached input over protocol-normalized eligible input for the selected window.|当前周期内按 Token 加权的缓存输入占比，分母为协议归一化后的可缓存输入。
Total includes serving and recovery, with the legacy cash fallback. Subscription allocation is included in those amounts.|总计包含服务和恢复费用，并兼容历史现金费用字段；订阅分摊已包含其中。
Type a model name or select one from the catalog below.|输入模型名称，或从下方目录选择。
Unlisted models|未列出的模型
Usage is scoped to this Local Ferry runtime.|用量统计仅覆盖当前 Ferry 实例。
Use a subdirectory inside ferry/ (or the existing smart-api/ prefix). The bucket must already exist.|使用 ferry/ 下的子目录，已有 smart-api/ 路径仍可用。存储桶须已存在。
Use an existing Codex CLI session without retaining the uploaded file.|使用现有 Codex CLI 会话，不保留上传的文件。
Use the browser OAuth flow after creation.|创建后通过浏览器完成 OAuth 流程。
Use the channel’s supported authenticated model catalog. The Provider API key remains scoped to that channel.|使用此渠道支持的认证模型目录，渠道 API 密钥仅用于该渠道。
Use your own S3 or compatible storage. Leave off to use the server’s project MinIO connection.|使用自己的 S3 或兼容存储；关闭时使用服务端项目 MinIO 连接。
Volcengine Plan control plane|火山引擎套餐控制面
Your reviewed route:|已审核路由：
Catalog discovery is read-only. Only uncached Provider / endpoint / model / protocol combinations send a minimal, potentially billable request; the whole catalog is never probed. Forced refresh remains available through the management API.|目录发现仅读取数据。仅对未缓存的渠道、端点、模型与协议组合发送最小验证请求，可能产生费用；不会验证整个目录。可通过管理 API 强制刷新。
Verification can record Text, Streaming, Images, Tools, Parallel tools, Reasoning, native Structured output, and Vision. A complete cache hit sends no inference request; only Management API refresh=true forces re-verification. Context window and Maximum output remain authoritative catalog or operator-configured fields.|验证可记录文本、流式输出、图像、工具、并行工具、推理、原生结构化输出与视觉能力。完整命中缓存时不发送推理请求，仅管理 API 的 refresh=true 强制重新验证。上下文窗口和最大输出仍取权威目录或管理员配置。
New upstream models are added without removing configured models. Missing same-name Logical Models are created automatically with this Provider route; existing custom models and routes are preserved. Catalog sync does not run inference or capability probes.|同步仅添加新上游模型，不移除已配置模型；缺少同名逻辑模型时自动创建并关联此渠道，保留现有自定义模型与路由。目录同步不执行推理或能力验证。
New requests may use fallback providers or fail when no eligible route remains.|新请求可能使用备用渠道，无可用路由时将失败。
Existing conversation bindings and in-flight recovery can be affected.|现有会话绑定和执行中的恢复可能受影响。
Ferry will automatically disable and remove it.|Ferry 将自动停用并移除此连接。
Routes that lose their last upstream supply will be detached, and models left without a default route will be disabled.|失去最后一个上游模型的路由将被移除；没有默认路由的模型将被停用。
In-flight requests finish on their current revision.|执行中的请求继续使用当前版本完成。
New requests may recover on another connection, fall back to another provider, or fail when no eligible route remains.|新请求可能通过其他连接恢复或转到备用渠道，无可用路由时将失败。
New requests for this model will stop routing.|此模型的新请求将停止路由。
Existing conversation bindings may migrate or fail, while in-flight requests finish on their current revision.|现有会话绑定可能迁移或失败，执行中的请求继续使用当前版本完成。
Existing conversation bindings will be dropped; in-flight requests finish on their current revision.|现有会话绑定将被移除，执行中的请求继续使用当前版本完成。
This cannot be undone except by restoring a previous revision.|此操作只能通过恢复之前的版本撤销。
Models left without a default route will be disabled, and existing conversations will migrate or fail if no route remains.|没有默认路由的模型将被停用；无剩余路由时，现有会话将迁移或失败。
Delete automatically removes this provider from routes, disables Logical Models left without a default route, and migrates existing conversations.|删除将自动从路由移除此渠道，停用没有默认路由的逻辑模型，并迁移现有会话。
